    "Gyro aiming turns controller rotation into mouse movement. Choose a touch for Activation, or Always. Save & Apply changes and enable output, then choose Calibrate. Put the controller down on a stable surface, or hold it still, before starting calibration. With touch activation, release the control after calibration, then touch again to aim. Calibration resets sensor bias without changing your mappings; it requires active output, fresh motion data and no profile operation in progress.": {
      "comment": "Controller sensor settings and explicit gyro calibration guidance.",
      "extractionState": "manual"
